7. Bf5 Ng8 { At this point, Baburin gives the following variation: } 8. h5 $1 Ne7 ( { or } 8... Nh6 9. Be6 Kh7 10. Kf6 ) 
9. h6+ Kh8 10. Be4 Ng8 11. g4 Ne7 12. Bf3 Ng8 13. Bg2 Ne7 14. Be4 Ng8 15. Bg6 Ne7 16. Bf7 Kh7 17. Kf6 { and White wins. } 
